 A quarter of an hour?

58
00:03:19,250 --> 00:03:24,860
 On the other hand, you might make your house the equal of the Medici, the Ferraris, the Viscontis.

59
00:03:25,150 --> 00:03:26,130
 Yes, who knows?

60
00:03:26,450 --> 00:03:28,750
 It could be amusing to meet this genius.

61
00:03:29,270 --> 00:03:30,090
 Go and get him.

